      en: ["The Vatnsfell power plant was commissioned in the year 2001.", "The total installed capacity of the station is 90 megawatts.", "It utilizes a hydraulic head of 67 meters from Lake Þórisvatn.", "The plant is equipped with two vertical Francis turbines.", "Vatnsfell functions primarily as a peaking power plant for the grid.", "The facility is operated entirely via remote control from Reykjavík."],
